## Case: legacy-23-actor-001-start-hook
id: "legacy.23_actor.001_start_hook"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "start_hook.at"
```auto
task Greeter {
    fn start() ! {
        print("Greeter started")
    }
    on {
        1 -> {
            print("got msg")
        }
    }
}

fn main() {
    let h = Task.spawn("Greeter", 16)
    h.send(1)
}
```

