## Case: legacy-23-actor-007-named-variants
id: "legacy.23_actor.007_named_variants"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "named_variants.at"
```auto
task Counter {
    count = 0
    fn start() ! {
    }
    on {
        Add(val) -> {
            count = count + val
            if count == 8 {
                print("reached eight")
            }
        }
        Reset -> {
            count = 0
            print("reset")
        }
    }
}

fn main() {
    let h = Task.spawn("Counter", 16)
    h.send(Add(3))
    h.send(Add(5))
    h.send(Reset)
}
```

