## Case: legacy-23-actor-012-external-enum-msg
id: "legacy.23_actor.012_external_enum_msg"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "external_enum_msg.at"
```auto
pub enum Event {
    A
    B(str)
}

task Sink {
    fn start() ! {
    }
    on {
        ev Event -> {
            is ev {
                Event.A -> {
                    print("got A")
                }
                Event.B(s) -> {
                    print("got B")
                    print(s)
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

fn main() {
    let h = Task.spawn("Sink", 16)
    h.send(Event.A)
    h.send(Event.B("hello"))
}
```

### VM result
#ignore
check-id: "vm-stdout"

```text
got A
got B
hello
```

