## Case: handler-spawn
id: "av.parity.1090.handler-spawn"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1090"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
task Leaf { on { n int -> { reply(n + 1) } } }
task Root {
 on {
  n int -> {
   let child = Task.spawn("Leaf", 1)
   let value = child.ask(n).await
   child.stop()
   reply(value)
  }
 }
}
fn main() int { let h = Task.spawn("Root", 1); return h.ask(41).await }
```

### Probe av
recipe: "ac-av/language-source-run-v1"
entry: "d_main"
