## Case: iterator-and-error
id: "av.parity.1090.iterator-and-error"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1090"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn numbers() ~Iter<int> { yield 19; yield 23 }
fn complain() int { fail("inside future") }
fn main() int {
 let f = ~{
  var result = 0
  for n in numbers() {
   sleep(1)
   result = result + n
  }
  try { let unused = complain() } catch e { print(e) }
  return result
 }
 return f.await
}
```

