## Case: typed-handle-return
id: "av.parity.1090.typed-handle-return"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1090"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
task One { on { n i64 -> { print("one") } } }
task Two { on { n i64 -> { print("two") } } }
fn make() TaskRef<i64> { return Task.spawn("Two", 1) }
fn pass(h TaskRef<i64>) TaskRef<i64> { return h }
fn main() int {
 let original = Task.spawn("One", 1)
 let other = pass(make())
 original.send(1)
 other.send(2)
 original.stop()
 other.stop()
 return 42
}
```

